      "writtenOn": "2021-11-24T17:38:48Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Not directly related to this change: should we reject RawConfig requests from apps, since it potentially allows bypassing our restrictions?",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 186,
        "startChar": 12,
        "endLine": 186,
        "endChar": 88
      },
      "revId": "07889f1fef63be51a2aa5304ae85e6505a1ec424",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "ab3887a0_a2498107",
        "filename": "virtualizationservice/src/aidl.rs",
        "patchSetId": 2
      },
      "lineNbr": 186,
      "author": {
        "id": 1132673
      },
      "writtenOn": "2021-11-25T02:05:11Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I don\u0027t think we should. It can\u0027t bypass the restriction being enforced by this change as we require that \"all\" partition images to be not labeled as app_data_file when RawConfig is used.",
      "parentUuid": "ed8dd19d_949b3cd5",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 186,
        "startChar": 12,
        "endLine": 186,
        "endChar": 88
      },
      "revId": "07889f1fef63be51a2aa5304ae85e6505a1ec424",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "20d8bbde_52af4de5",
        "filename": "virtualizationservice/src/aidl.rs",
        "patchSetId": 2
      },
      "lineNbr": 193,
      "author": {
        "id": 1060831
      },
      "writtenOn": "2021-11-24T17:38:48Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Hmm. What about other app data file types, like privapp_data_file, or anything else that is app_data_file_type?\n\nTo be fair we are only allowing access from platform_app, and that is required to use app_data_file in seapp_contexts.\n\nBut things other than untrusted apps may have write access to all sorts of directories that aren\u0027t app_data_file_type at all.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 193,
        "startChar": 28,
        "endLine": 193,
        "endChar": 41
      },
      "revId": "07889f1fef63be51a2aa5304ae85e6505a1ec424",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": false,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "f755ee07_b5fd0826",
        "filename": "virtualizationservice/src/aidl.rs",
        "patchSetId": 2
      },
      "lineNbr": 193,
      "author": {
        "id": 1132673
      },
      "writtenOn": "2021-11-25T02:05:11Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Our sepolicy rules allow only app_data_file - for the instance disk - to crosvm. So privapp_data_file and other app_data_file_type are already prohibited by sepolicy and don\u0027t need to be checked here.",
      "parentUuid": "20d8bbde_52af4de5",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 193,
        "startChar": 28,
        "endLine": 193,
        "endChar": 41
      },
